{"seq":2,"slug":"alerting-regression-detection","title":"告警与回归检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/operations/alerting-regression-detection","wordCount":679,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"告警与回归检测\">告警与回归检测</h1><p>CI 性能预算守住了合入前的底线，但代码合入后呢？第三方脚本更新、CDN 配置漂移、A/B 实验副作用、流量模式变化——这些不经代码变更就能让性能退化的因素，只有生产环境的实时告警和回归检测才能捕捉。告警系统的核心挑战不是&quot;告了没有&quot;，而是&quot;告得准不准&quot;——既不漏报真回归，也不因噪声导致告警疲劳。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>性能告警体系需要在灵敏度和误报率之间找到平衡点：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[性能数据流入&lt;br/&gt;RUM / web-vitals] --&gt; B[实时聚合&lt;br/&gt;滑动窗口统计]&#10;    B --&gt; C{检测规则}&#10;    C --&gt; D[静态阈值&lt;br/&gt;P75 &gt; 200ms]&#10;    C --&gt; E[相对变化&lt;br/&gt;比基线恶化 &gt; 20%]&#10;    C --&gt; F[异常检测&lt;br/&gt;偏离历史模式]&#10;    D --&gt; G[告警触发]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[上下文附加&lt;br/&gt;时间/版本/用户群]&#10;    H --&gt; I[分发&lt;br/&gt;Slack/PagerDuty/Email]\">graph TD\n    A[性能数据流入&lt;br/&gt;RUM / web-vitals] --&gt; B[实时聚合&lt;br/&gt;滑动窗口统计]\n    B --&gt; C{检测规则}\n    C --&gt; D[静态阈值&lt;br/&gt;P75 &gt; 200ms]\n    C --&gt; E[相对变化&lt;br/&gt;比基线恶化 &gt; 20%]\n    C --&gt; F[异常检测&lt;br/&gt;偏离历史模式]\n    D --&gt; G[告警触发]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[上下文附加&lt;br/&gt;时间/版本/用户群]\n    H --&gt; I[分发&lt;br/&gt;Slack/PagerDuty/Email]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检测策略</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态阈值</td>\n<td>CWV Good/Poor 边界</td>\n<td>简单直观、零延迟</td>\n<td>不适应季节性波动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相对变化</td>\n<td>发版前后对比</td>\n<td>自适应基线</td>\n<td>需定义基线窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常检测</td>\n<td>渐进退化、突发事件</td>\n<td>不需预设阈值</td>\n<td>需历史数据训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>趋势告警</td>\n<td>连续 N 天恶化</td>\n<td>过滤瞬时波动</td>\n<td>检测延迟较高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实时告警管线架构\">实时告警管线架构</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface AlertRule {&#10;  metric: &#39;LCP&#39; | &#39;INP&#39; | &#39;CLS&#39;;&#10;  condition: &#39;threshold&#39; | &#39;relative&#39; | &#39;anomaly&#39;;&#10;  params: {&#10;    threshold?: number;&#10;    baselineWindow?: string; // e.g. &#39;7d&#39;&#10;    changePercent?: number;&#10;    consecutiveBreaches?: number;&#10;  };&#10;  severity: &#39;warning&#39; | &#39;critical&#39;;&#10;  channels: string[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;const alertRules: AlertRule[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    metric: &#39;INP&#39;,&#10;    condition: &#39;threshold&#39;,&#10;    params: { threshold: 200, consecutiveBreaches: 3 },&#10;    severity: &#39;critical&#39;,&#10;    channels: [&#39;slack-perf&#39;, &#39;pagerduty&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    metric: &#39;LCP&#39;,&#10;    condition: &#39;relative&#39;,&#10;    params: { baselineWindow: &#39;7d&#39;, changePercent: 20 },&#10;    severity: &#39;warning&#39;,&#10;    channels: [&#39;slack-perf&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    metric: &#39;CLS&#39;,&#10;    condition: &#39;threshold&#39;,&#10;    params: { threshold: 0.1, consecutiveBreaches: 5 },&#10;    severity: &#39;warning&#39;,&#10;    channels: [&#39;slack-perf&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AlertRule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  metric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'LCP'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'INP'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CLS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  condition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'threshold'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'relative'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'anomaly'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    baselineWindow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// e.g. '7d'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    changePercent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    consecutiveBreaches</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  severity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'warning'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'critical'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  channels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> alertRules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AlertRule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    metric: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'INP'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    condition: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'threshold'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    params: { threshold: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, consecutiveBreaches: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    severity: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'critical'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    channels: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'slack-perf'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pagerduty'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    metric: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'LCP'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    condition: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'relative'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    params: { baselineWindow: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7d'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, changePercent: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    severity: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'warning'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    channels: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'slack-perf'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    metric: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CLS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    condition: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'threshold'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    params: { threshold: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, consecutiveBreaches: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    severity: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'warning'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    channels: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'slack-perf'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>consecutiveBreaches</code> 是降低误报的关键——单次超标可能是正常波动，连续 3-5 个采样窗口超标才触发告警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"release-级别回归检测\">Release 级别回归检测</h2><p>性能回归最常见的根因是代码发布。将 RUM 数据与 Release 版本关联，可以精确定位哪次发布引入了退化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 发版时标记 release 信息&#10;import { onLCP, onINP, onCLS } from &#39;web-vitals&#39;;&#10;&#10;const RELEASE = process.env.RELEASE_VERSION; // e.g. &#39;v2.14.3&#39;&#10;const DEPLOY_TIME = process.env.DEPLOY_TIMESTAMP;&#10;&#10;function reportWithRelease(metric: any) {&#10;  sendToRUM({&#10;    ...metric,&#10;    release: RELEASE,&#10;    deployTime: DEPLOY_TIME,&#10;  });&#10;}&#10;&#10;onLCP(reportWithRelease);&#10;onINP(reportWithRelease);&#10;onCLS(reportWithRelease);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 发版时标记 release 信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { onLCP, onINP, onCLS } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'web-vitals'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> RELEASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">RELEASE_VERSION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// e.g. 'v2.14.3'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> DEPLOY_TIME</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">DEPLOY_TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reportWithRelease</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">metric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  sendToRUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">metric,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    release: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">RELEASE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    deployTime: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">DEPLOY_TIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onLCP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(reportWithRelease);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onINP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(reportWithRelease);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onCLS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(reportWithRelease);</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 对比当前版本与前一版本的 P75&#10;WITH current_release AS (&#10;  SELECT percentile_cont(0.75) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY inp_value) as p75&#10;  FROM vitals WHERE release = &#39;v2.14.3&#39;&#10;),&#10;previous_release AS (&#10;  SELECT percentile_cont(0.75) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY inp_value) as p75&#10;  FROM vitals WHERE release = &#39;v2.14.2&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;  c.p75 as current_p75,&#10;  p.p75 as previous_p75,&#10;  ((c.p75 - p.p75) / p.p75 * 100) as change_percent&#10;FROM current_release c, previous_release p;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 对比当前版本与前一版本的 P75</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current_release </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">75</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark: